-> Light\n  (if (= (mod steps 3) 0)\n      light\n      (if (= (mod steps 3) 1)\n          (trafficLightStep light)\n          (trafficLightStep (trafficLightStep light)))))\n```"))
(:trial :key "asl|powMod|synDs41Flash|1" :arm "asl" :task "powMod" :family "A" :model "synDs41Flash" :served "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017" :rep 1 :rawPass true :healedPass true :solved true :calls 1 :repairTurns 0 :firstFail "ok" :stages ("ok") :tokIn (1086) :tokOut (2387) :tokInSum 1086 :tokOutSum 2387 :tokToGreen 3473 :sysTok 799 :costPico 1595100000 :wallMs 23208 :headerStripped false :promptSha "9067790ff76cadd3a77594a8ae145a600b4071f7bdc26606828e4e2dcba55fa2" :replies ("```asl\nfn powModLoop b: Int64 e: Int64 m: Int64 acc: Int64 -> Int64\n  (cond\n    ((= e 0) (% acc m))\n    ((= (% e 2) 0) (powModLoop (% (* b b) m) (/ e 2) m acc))\n    (else (powModLoop b (- e 1) m (% (* acc b) m))))\n\nfn powMod base: Int64 exponent: Int64 modulus: Int64 -> Int64\n  (powModLoop (% base modulus) exponent modulus 1)\n```"))
(:trial :key "asl|powMod|synDs41Flash|2" :arm "asl" :task "powMod" :family "A" :model "synDs41Flash" :served "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017" :rep 2 :rawPass true :healedPass true :solved true :calls 1 :repairTurns 0 :firstFail "ok" :stages ("ok") :tokIn (1086) :tokOut (3122) :tokInSum 1086 :tokOutSum 3122 :tokToGreen 4208 :sysTok 799 :costPico 2036100000 :wallMs 24908 :headerStripped false :promptSha "9067790ff76cadd3a77594a8ae145a600b4071f7bdc26606828e4e2dcba55fa2" :replies ("```asl\nfn powMod base: Int64 exponent: Int64 modulus: Int64 -> Int64\n  (let [(b (% base modulus))]\n    (cond\n      ((= exponent 0) (% 1 modulus))\n      ((= (% exponent 2) 0)\n        (let [(half (powMod b (/ exponent 2) modulus))]\n          (% (* half half) modulus)))\n      (else\n        (% (* b (powMod b (- exponent 1) modulus)) modulus))))\n```"))
